{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/reviews/id326087828"}, "name":{"label":"Blubpje"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-19T02:09:56-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"219"}, "id":{"label":"14567545260"}, "title":{"label":"Fix bugs"}, "content":{"label":"I will change this review if developers fix melius, reset button etc.\nIt’s your responsibility as developer, else I want my money back.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Applicatie"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/reviews/id1969720870"}, "name":{"label":"theresetter"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-17T08:47:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"219"}, "id":{"label":"14560874298"}, "title":{"label":"Doesn’t work as good as it used to"}, "content":{"label":"I am using Quittr for over 1,5 years now, and i am really happy with this app in general.\n\nHowever, it has come to my conclusion that this app is starting to show more bugs then ever before, and i honestly don’t think the developers are renewing this app is any way (this is an assumption, it just feels like this for a couple of weeks now).\n\nIf this app doesn’t improve it’s general functions, such as: changing profile pic or resetting your streak (wich obviously already sucks for people who relapsed), i am scared this community will fall.\n\nI deleted the app a few minutes ago, because the chats won’t load in and the community chat just doesn’t renew. I will try to dowload it again, to see if that has fixed some of the problems that i am having with this app atm.\n\nPlease developers, i am speaking directly to you. People like me could really use a helping hand with this “problem” of ours, but most functions just don’t work properly. \n\nPlease keep improving the app and i will happily stay a part of this amazing community!\n\nThank you…..", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Applicatie"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
