{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/reviews/id1458134346"}, "name":{"label":"John Dagblad"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-01-20T23:42:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"167"}, "id":{"label":"13658171004"}, "title":{"label":"Does not really solve the problem"}, "content":{"label":"This doesn’t really solve the problem guys, let’s face it. Nobody wants all the functions like “community”, or “learning”. People who want to quit an addiction just want to quit. So i would classify this yet again as just another money grub.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Applicatie"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/reviews/id432445584"}, "name":{"label":"De Mascotte"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-24T08:40:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"163"}, "id":{"label":"13550333883"}, "title":{"label":"Real problem, rigged quiz"}, "content":{"label":"Came across the app. It is a real problem for some people. Wanted to take te quiz for fun. Filled it in rarely watching porn and yet 67% above average?! Just a way to talk people into a problem they don’t have. Isn’t the market big enough for the people with a problem or just want to quit without having one?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Applicatie"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/reviews/id314437277"}, "name":{"label":"Gratification 1"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-24T16:48:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"148"}, "id":{"label":"13180632206"}, "title":{"label":"Community is great but the ui sucks"}, "content":{"label":"Some of the I would say like 40 percent of the time This app does not work properly. Sometimes I am not able to reply or post. Sometime it doesn’t show you the post. It show the same post again and again and I can’t scroll down to look at older posts. \n\nI like the concept of this app but the user interaction sucks. The only thing that makes me want to keep on using this app is the community.\n\nPlease Fix those issue and than I can rate it 5 star. The only reason I gave it a 3 stars is because of the community. If not for\nThe community i would give this a 0 or a negative star and would have deleted this trash app that doesn’t even work properly most of the time. \n\nSo app developers please fix this.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nl/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Applicatie"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
